%description:
Tests that a tail loss probe (RFC 8985 section 7, tlpEnabled=true) repairs a
lost last segment. The tester deletes the last of four segments. Each ACK
of new data arms the probe timeout again (section 7.2), and after the ACK
of 1501 it is 2*SRTT plus 200 ms, because one segment is in flight. The
probe at t=1.212 retransmits 1501:2001, and its ACK covers the flight, so
no RTO is necessary. That ACK gives no D-SACK, so the probe repaired a
loss, but the sender decides only at the first ACK above the probe
(section 7.4.2). That ACK comes at t=6.003, and the sender sets ssthresh
and cwnd as a fast recovery does.
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

network = inet.test.moduletest.lib.TcpTestNet1

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.testing=false

*.tcptester.script="a6 delete"

*.cli_app.active=true
*.cli_app.localAddress="10.0.0.1"
*.cli_app.localPort=1000
*.cli_app.connectAddress="10.0.0.2"
*.cli_app.connectPort=2000
*.cli_app.tOpen=0s
*.cli_app.tSend=-1s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=0B
*.cli_app.sendScript="1 2000;6 500"
*.cli_app.tClose=-1s

*.srv_app.active=false
*.srv_app.localAddress="10.0.0.2"
*.srv_app.localPort=2000
*.srv_app.connectAddress="10.0.0.1"
*.srv_app.connectPort=1000
*.srv_app.tOpen=0s
*.srv_app.tSend=-1s
*.srv_app.sendBytes=0B
*.srv_app.sendScript=""
*.srv_app.tClose=-1s

*.*_tcp.advertisedWindow = 5000
*.*_tcp.sackSupport = true
*.*_tcp.mss = 500
*.*_tcp.tcpAlgorithmClass = "TcpReno"
*.*_tcp.tlpEnabled = true
*.*_tcp.increasedIWEnabled = true



%# the probe retransmits the lost tail...
%contains: stdout
TLP: probing by retransmitting the last 500 bytes

%contains: stdout
[1.213 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1501:2001(500) ack 501 win 5000

%contains: stdout
[1.215 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 5000

%# ...and the first ACK above the probe gives the congestion response
%contains: stdout
TLP: the probe repaired a lost tail, cwnd reduced to ssthresh=1000

%not-contains: stdout
Performing retransmission
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
